WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:01,740
It's Fan Qianxiang

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,280
plowing deep into the middle of the night

3
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:07,880
Why did the eldest lady of Qianbao Group suddenly come over? Open the bar and invite her in.

4
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:11,200
Chairman Zhang Da’s nightlife is really colorful.

5
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:14,020
Wouldn't it disturb your good business to show up uninvited in the middle of the night?

6
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:18,380
How could Miss Fan disturb Zhao Qian's tea service when she came to the humble house to escape the noise?

7
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:21,260
Mr. Fan, please have some tea and listen quickly.

8
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:24,080
This Bai Fumei drove a sports car to my door in the middle of the night

9
00:00:24,580 --> 00:00:26,120
Definitely trying to chase our boss

10
00:00:27,530 --> 00:00:28,810
So what about the wealthy daughter?

11
00:00:29,070 --> 00:00:33,080
Our boss is the only one who can stand up to the rich and powerful. He wants to be beautiful.

12
00:00:33,790 --> 00:00:35,830
I came to see you today not to talk about nothing.

13
00:00:36,610 --> 00:00:43,590
Changkang Medicine, owned by our Fan family, is in big trouble. Only you can save Zhang Tong. I like you.

14
00:00:43,850 --> 00:00:44,870
really like it

15
00:00:45,130 --> 00:00:46,150
can you be my boyfriend
